"His Highness is innocent! He knew nothing! I tried to probe him for rebel sympathies, but never got so much as a nibble!"

//【ｅｔｃ／側近金子】
<voice name='ｅｔｃ／側近金子' class='その他男声' src='voice/md01/0230310e148'>
